Subject: [PATCH 10/13] feat: raise the mod integration API to 1.1.0

Adds CharacterListSentEvent, GameServerSelectingEvent and the
imlight:client_process_jobs registry. Mods that need them depend on
imlight ^1.1.0.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: [AI session link removed]
---
 src/Imlight.CoreLib/Modding/ImlightModding.cs | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/Imlight.CoreLib/Modding/ImlightModding.cs b/src/Imlight.CoreLib/Modding/ImlightModding.cs
index c6863b84..1828162f 100644
--- a/src/Imlight.CoreLib/Modding/ImlightModding.cs
+++ b/src/Imlight.CoreLib/Modding/ImlightModding.cs
@@ -62,7 +62,7 @@ public static class ImlightModding {
     /// Version of Imlight's mod-facing surface (events, registries, behaviors). Exposed to mods as the
     /// <c>imlight</c> dependency. Bump the major version on breaking changes to any of it.
     /// </summary>
-    public const string IntegrationApiVersion = "1.0.0";
+    public const string IntegrationApiVersion = "1.1.0";
 
     private const string NoPermissionReply = "You do not have permission to use this command.";
 
